---
layout: base.njk
title: "Toutes les prestations atelier | RED-K MOTORS Ivry-sur-Seine (94)"
description: "40 prestations atelier RED-K MOTORS à Ivry-sur-Seine : entretien, freinage, moteur, pneus, climatisation, carrosserie et pare-brise. Devis gratuit."
pageKey: prestations
hasHeroVideo: true
date: 2026-06-11
lastReviewed: 2026-06-11
sitemap:
  changefreq: weekly
  priority: 0.7
breadcrumb:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList"
  itemListElement:
    - "@type": "ListItem"
      position: 1
      name: "Accueil"
      item: "https://redkmotors.fr/"
    - "@type": "ListItem"
      position: 2
      name: "Prestations"
      item: "https://redkmotors.fr/prestations/"
faqSchema:
  "@context": "https://schema.org"
  "@type": "FAQPage"
  mainEntity:
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Comment choisir la bonne prestation ?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "Sélectionnez la prestation la plus proche de votre besoin dans la liste, ou contactez-nous par téléphone pour être orienté vers le bon service atelier."
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Chaque prestation inclut-elle un devis ?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "Oui. Chaque fiche prestation mène à un devis personnalisé après diagnostic ou inspection du véhicule."
    - "@type": "Question"
      name: "Les prestations sont-elles disponibles pour toutes les marques ?"
      acceptedAnswer:
        "@type": "Answer"
        text: "Oui, véhicules thermiques essence et diesel, toutes marques courantes."
---

{% set heroActions %}
<a class="btn btn--primary" href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" data-track="click_call" data-track-pos="prestations_hero">Appeler pour un devis</a>
<a class="btn btn--secondary" href="{{ site.whatsappUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-track="click_whatsapp" data-track-pos="prestations_hero">WhatsApp</a>
{% endset %}
{% set heroClass = "hero--subpage hero--conversion" %}
{% set heroAria = "prestations-hero-title" %}
{% set heroTitle = "Toutes nos prestations atelier" %}
{% set heroKicker = "Garage à Ivry-sur-Seine (94)" %}
{% set heroDesc = "40 prestations détaillées : entretien, freinage, moteur, pneus, climatisation, carrosserie et pare-brise." %}
{% set videoSrc = "hero.mp4" %}
{% include "hero-video.njk" %}

{% include "lp-trust-bar.njk" %}

<section class="presta-listing" aria-labelledby="presta-listing-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="presta-listing__head">
      <p class="section-kicker">Catalogue atelier</p>
      <h2 id="presta-listing-title" class="presta-listing__title">Toutes les prestations</h2>
      <p class="presta-listing__intro">
        Choisissez une fiche : quand intervenir, ce qui est contrôlé, devis à Ivry-sur-Seine.
        <span class="presta-listing__intro-links">
          <a href="/equipe/">Équipe</a>
          <a href="/tarifs/">Tarifs</a>
          <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </span>
      </p>
    </header>

    <nav class="presta-listing__nav" aria-label="Catégories de prestations">
      <ul class="presta-listing__nav-list">
        {% for category in prestations.categories %}
        <li>
          <a class="presta-listing__nav-link" href="#cat-{{ category.key }}">{{ category.navLabel or category.title }}</a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="presta-listing__grid">
      {% for category in prestations.categories %}
      <article class="presta-listing__card" id="cat-{{ category.key }}">
        <header class="presta-listing__card-head">
          <h3 class="presta-listing__card-title">{{ category.title }}</h3>
          <span class="presta-listing__count">{{ category.services | length }}</span>
        </header>
        <ul class="presta-listing__links">
          {% for service in category.services %}
          <li>
            <a
              class="presta-listing__link"
              href="/prestations/{{ service.slug }}/"
              data-track="click_prestation"
              data-track-pos="prestations_hub"
              data-track-label="{{ service.slug }}"
            >
              <span class="presta-listing__link-label">{{ service.name }}</span>
              <span class="presta-listing__link-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set pageReviews = "mecanique" | resolvePageReviews(googleReviews, 2) %}
{% if pageReviews and pageReviews.length %}
  {% include "reviews-page-block.njk" %}
{% endif %}

{% set lpId = pageKey %}
{% include "lp-related-services.njk" %}

<section class="faq" aria-labelledby="presta-hub-faq" data-animate="slide-up">
  <div class="container faq__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">FAQ</p>
      <h2 id="presta-hub-faq">Questions fréquentes</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq__list" data-accordion>
      <article class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Comment choisir la bonne prestation ?</button>
        <div class="faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Sélectionnez la prestation la plus proche de votre besoin, ou appelez le <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a> pour être orienté.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Chaque prestation inclut-elle un devis ?</button>
        <div class="faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Oui. Devis personnalisé après diagnostic ou inspection — gratuit et sans engagement.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="faq__item">
        <button class="faq__question" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Toutes marques ?</button>
        <div class="faq__answer" hidden>
          <p>Oui, essence et diesel, toutes marques courantes.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
